{"id": "EUVD-2026-95809", "enisaUuid": "e63bbc25-4f5a-3213-8992-f7473563f13e", "description": "PHPNuxBill through 2025.3.20 contains an authentication bypass vulnerability in RADIUS CHAP verification because Password::chap_verify() returns true when the supplied response does not match. Attackers who know a valid customer or PPPoE username can log in through MikroTik hotspot or PPPoE CHAP with any incorrect password to obtain network access and consume that customer's plan.", "datePublished": "2026-10-09T14:33:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T01:51:06", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:A/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/hotspotbilling/phpnuxbill/security/advisories/GHSA-6f62-x25v-9686", "https://github.com/hotspotbilling/phpnuxbill/blob/2025.3.13/system/autoload/Password.php#L48", "https://github.com/hotspotbilling/phpnuxbill", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/phpnuxbill-through-2025.3.20-chap-authentication-bypass-via-password-chap-verify"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108108", "GHSA-84mc-cxq8-4h6r"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "aa768ce6-a7f2-3d22-ad8f-a2ba3f6aa237", "product": {"name": "phpnuxbill", "vendor": {"name": "hotspotbilling"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642025.3.20"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e96fba9d-9b3a-3bd2-bc9a-c03870c2ae14", "vendor": {"name": "hotspotbilling"}}], "isExploited": false}